00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:51.990
So let's say I am vegan.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.760
If we'll head back
to the portal,

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:56.190
you can actually see
some memories stored

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:58.320
for that particular user.

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.210
So this is a memory-type turn.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:04.590
Turn is nothing but just the
conversation that the user

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:09.060
and the agent is doing
on our chat assistant.

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:12.450
So as we said, I'm
