00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:22.470
by the same fact ID of
my new fact so that

00:23:22.470 --> 00:23:24.480
that is done for an audit trail.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:28.290
As I explained before, if
after six months or a year

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:31.350
down the road you want to check
