00:25:47.730 --> 00:25:50.910
and based on your updated
dietary preference,

00:25:50.910 --> 00:25:58.740
so it's automatically picking up
the current fact that we have

00:25:58.740 --> 00:26:02.250
in our memories container
as we have already resolved

00:26:02.250 --> 00:26:03.900
that conflict and it's able

00:26:03.900 --> 00:26:07.830
to give us the correct
