00:26:48.600 --> 00:26:51.630
So we can see that a user
summary was extracted.

00:26:51.630 --> 00:26:59.550
If I run the query again, we
should be able to see -- yeah.

00:26:59.550 --> 00:27:01.410
So we can see the user summary.

