00:27:21.930 --> 00:27:25.260
So the agent memory toolkit
for Azure Cosmos DB is

00:27:25.260 --> 00:27:27.090
in public preview now.

00:27:27.090 --> 00:27:30.870
It has fact extraction,
auto-summarization,

00:27:30.870 --> 00:27:34.050
and there are package
