00:27:34.050 --> 00:27:38.790
to do conflict resolution,
extract different kind

00:27:38.790 --> 00:27:43.710
of memories, do user and
thread summarization.

00:27:43.710 --> 00:27:48.150
Next, LangChain Azure Cosmos
DB integration is also

00:27:48.150 --> 00:27:49.650
generally available.

00:27:49.650 --> 00:27:53.280
It's a integration package

00:27:53.280 --> 00:27:56.760
that has all the Cosmos DB
integration for LangChain

00:27:56.760 --> 00:27:58.650
and LangGraph that
were used to build

00:27:58.650 --> 00:28:00.480
