code that we shared,

00:45:52.590 --> 00:45:54.870
including a workshop
if you want to walk

00:45:54.870 --> 00:45:57.270
through building this
application yourself.

00:45:57.270 --> 00:45:59.070
We've also got several
links for some

00:45:59.070 --> 00:46:01.710
of the various announcements
